sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host (Claude)
    participant C as MCP Client
    participant S as yeorot-mcp
    participant Y as yeorot API

    rect rgb(235,243,255)
    note over C,S: 1. Initialization - protocol & capability negotiation
    C->>S: initialize
    S-->>C: supported capabilities (tools ...)
    C->>S: notifications/initialized
    end

    rect rgb(235,255,243)
    note over C,S: 2. Tool discovery
    C->>S: tools/list
    S-->>C: tool list (name - description - inputSchema)
    end

    rect rgb(255,247,235)
    note over H,Y: 3. Tool execution during conversation
    H->>C: "show my tasks today"
    C->>S: tools/call - getTodayTasks
    S->>Y: GET /tasks?date=...
    Y-->>S: JSON result
    S-->>C: tool result (content)
    C-->>H: LLM generates answer from result
    end
